  "disclaimer": "本文件只是候选参考稿，不是本项目的正式 L0 原文。只有主编对照底本实物签字之后，才能把对应条目录入 inputs/human/47-kun-canonical.csv，由 gxwd texts import 写入 data/canonical-texts.json。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text_id": "H47-gua_ci",
      "text_type": "gua_ci",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "困：亨，贞，大人吉，无咎。有言不信。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-tuan",
      "text_type": "tuan",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "困，刚掩也。险以说，困而不失其所亨，其唯君子乎！贞大人吉，以刚中也。有言不信，尚口乃穷也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-da_xiang",
      "text_type": "da_xiang",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "泽无水，困。君子以致命遂志。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-yao_ci-L1",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": "初六",
      "candidate_text": "臀困于株木，入于幽谷，三岁不觌。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-yao_ci-L2",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": "九二",
      "candidate_text": "困于酒食，朱绂方来，利用享祀。征凶，无咎。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-yao_ci-L3",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": "六三",
      "candidate_text": "困于石，据于蒺藜，入于其宫，不见其妻，凶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-yao_ci-L4",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": "九四",
      "candidate_text": "来徐徐，困于金车，吝，有终。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-yao_ci-L5",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": "九五",
      "candidate_text": "劓刖，困于赤绂，乃徐有说，利用祭祀。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-yao_ci-L6",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": "上六",
      "candidate_text": "困于葛藟，于臲卼，曰动悔有悔，征吉。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-xiao_xiang-L1",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“入于幽谷”，幽不明也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-xiao_xiang-L2",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“困于酒食”，中有庆也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-xiao_xiang-L3",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“据于蒺藜”，乘刚也；“入于其宫，不见其妻”，不祥也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-xiao_xiang-L4",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“来徐徐”，志在下也；虽不当位，有与也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-xiao_xiang-L5",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“劓刖”，志未得也；“乃徐有说”，以中直也；利用祭祀，受福也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H47-xiao_xiang-L6",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“困于葛藟，于臲卼”，未当也；“动悔有悔”，吉行也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    }
  ]
}
